    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgzbM-atFVA82Kkf3WEF7Sg4NKvC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 近几年有很多这种创意料理非常火，香菜拿铁、酸奶皮蛋、板蓝根美式，眼前一黑的食物创意们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="291">04:51</a> 黑暗料理好像在吃播界很火？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">07:00</a> 中华料理和白人饭有啥区别？主播们老家的菜肴特色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 活珠子，生腌，蚕蛹，有哪些神奇食物大众不接受但是你自己试过觉得还不错的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a> 有哪些又贵又难吃的食物呢？商家你给我说中国人不骗中国人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> 咱们吃一道菜满足哪些特点，就不是黑暗料理？</span></p><span></span><p><span>近期不是快新年了嘛！我们频道也在准备新年小版画想抽送给听友们！非常感谢大家一直以来的收听与支持请大家持续关注后续！感谢！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiSIjyJCMdTSm3gvI-cmo91rXDzD.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>本期背景音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>BUMP OF CHICKEN - Sleep Walking Orchestra1</span></p><span></span><p><span>莫文蔚 - 初恋（食神主题曲）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5accbc134eacab3e149a6096?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5accbc134eacab3e149a6096&amp;apptime=1730378024&amp;share_id=69f3f64f251c4d2db6fc2d0a56f9c62e" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5accbc134eacab3e149a6096?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5accbc134eacab3e149a6096&amp;apptime=1730378024&amp;share_id=69f3f64f251c4d2db6fc2d0a56f9c62e"><span>小申</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cede52b000000001802647e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5accbc134eacab3e149a6096&amp;apptime=1730378077&amp;share_id=5b73e6a594574729a837ef48e5dfec99" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cede52b000000001802647e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5accbc134eacab3e149a6096&amp;apptime=1730378077&amp;share_id=5b73e6a59