    <guid isPermaLink="false">6705702081cdab3a939b4a74</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Oct 2024 17:47:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>（主播最近忙于学业疑似失去所有力气和手段，上周鸽了一次十分抱歉再也不会了🐦）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fiyt-Z9PXdjhaSlrAAADjfb1i9Oi.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a>打雷女士婚讯与大家对于diva们的择偶坏品味的无法释怀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a>号称是美国李清照的打雷女士的个人艺术风格探析</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1051">17:31</a>艺术家或者名人“塌房”，还能欣赏他的作品吗？从波兰斯基的《我控诉》到艺术史的“塌无可塌”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">26:08</a>怎么看待近年出现的女性艺术家们会因为不够女权的思想被质疑这件事情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2103">35:03</a>海口的侃爷‘告诉过你’他音乐很棒但人打个问号，推理、恐怖这一块更是半黄金半腐臭</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2509">41:49</a>爱丽丝门罗事件与重看《破坏者》，哎</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2728">45:28</a>都是'大烂人'但好像每个行业的品评标准不尽相同</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a>对相声的一些敬而远之以及怎么让自己不再踏入同一条河流</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgofs4D1Hp-eh1B3Q14SZxS2rgCX.JPG"></figure><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5accbc134eacab3e149a6096?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5accbc134eacab3e149a6096&amp;apptime=1728409419&amp;share_id=2d55a10546fe482cb0c14a29dffff637" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5accbc134eacab3e149a6096?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5accbc134eacab3e149a6096&amp;apptime=1728409419&amp;share_id=2d55a10546fe482cb0c14a29dffff637"><span>小申</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cede52b000000001802647e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5accbc134eacab3e149a6096&amp;apptime=1728409434&amp;share_id=03b4ed57bb594b07830872b1cf077527" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5cede52b000000001802647e?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5accbc134eacab3e149a6096&amp;apptime=1728409434&amp;share_id=03b4ed57bb594b07830872b1cf077527"><span>小萌</span></a></p><p><span>如果喜欢我们的节目不要忘了点赞转发收藏评论！非常感谢！</span></p><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><p><span>Lana Del Rey - Kintsugi</span></p><p><span>Lana Del Rey - Radio</span></p>]]></description>
